stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ResolvingRepo : HandleRequest creates agent_run

    ResolvingRepo --> Creating : GitHub repo resolved\ninstallation token minted
    ResolvingRepo --> FailedNoSandbox : repo inaccessible\nor GitHub App missing

    Creating --> RunningFresh : Daytona.Create(snapshot)\nlabels + optional cache volume
    Creating --> FailedNoSandbox : create failed after transient retries

    state RunningFresh {
        [*] --> SessionCreated
        SessionCreated --> BootstrapOptional : write/run agent.sh
        BootstrapOptional --> ClaudeRunning : setup complete\n[hetchy] running claude
        ClaudeRunning --> PRVerified : PR URL parsed\nGitHub validates repo/branch/base
        ClaudeRunning --> AgentFailed : non-zero exit,\nwall timeout, idle timeout,\nor PR not verified
    }

    PRVerified --> Archiving : delete Daytona session
    Archiving --> Archived : Stop + Archive

    Archived --> Resuming : follow-up arrives
    Resuming --> RunningFollowUp : StartWithTimeout(5m)\nfresh installation token
    Resuming --> ResumeFailed : timeout or Daytona error

    state RunningFollowUp {
        [*] --> FollowupSession
        FollowupSession --> FollowupClaude : write/run followup.sh\ncheckout existing branch
        FollowupClaude --> FollowupVerified : PR URL parsed\nGitHub validates head branch
        FollowupClaude --> FollowupFailed : command or validation failed
    }

    FollowupVerified --> Archiving

    AgentFailed --> DebugRunning : fresh-run sandbox left\nfor debugging
    DebugRunning --> Creating : next message archives orphan\nthen creates a new sandbox

    FollowupFailed --> FollowupDebug : conversation still has PRURL\nsandbox left available
    FollowupDebug --> Resuming : next follow-up retries\nsame PR conversation

    FailedNoSandbox --> [*] : user can retry in same chat
    ResumeFailed --> [*] : user can retry or start fresh
    Archived --> Archived : no follow-up\nfilesystem preserved

    RunningFresh --> CancelFresh : user cancels
    CancelFresh --> Archived : cleanup stop/archive
    RunningFollowUp --> CancelFollowUp : user cancels
    CancelFollowUp --> FollowupDebug : session stops\nsandbox kept for next turn

    note right of Creating
        Fresh sandboxes use the configured Daytona snapshot.
        Hetchy may mount a pooled dependency cache volume
        under /home/daytona/.hetchy-cache.
    end note

    note right of ClaudeRunning
        run-script timeout limits:
        wall clock = 45 minutes
        idle output = 15 minutes
        user heartbeat = every minute
    end note

    note right of Archived
        Archived sandboxes keep the checkout,
        branch, git history, caches, and generated files.
        Follow-ups resume from this filesystem.
    end note

    note left of RunningFresh
        If the bot process dies mid-command, agent_run
        recovery claims the lease, replays Daytona command
        logs through the same line router, projects the
        conversation, and archives on recovered success.
    end note
